{"bindings": [{"id": "syr.dw.decides", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-6b57a55b05cf", "line_id": "ln-0b32c5f05e57", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "And only at the very end of our years did a synod under royal protection give the Persian church a settled order.", "world": "syr"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "witt.quote.christs-return-to-judgment", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-b2694a02dd4b", "line_id": "ln-54108533fc03", "records_commit": "1a716fe86fc084a46b5241dfac5952be65a0c30d", "sentence": "We taught that the punishments of the condemned and of the devils will come to an end.", "world": "witt"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "don.dw.the-emperor-and-the-church", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-b0c2ed38a4be", "line_id": "ln-40e05a1186ab", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "The persecutions in our own time sent us into tunnels.", "world": "don"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "syr.term.tahwyata", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-2aa7dff317e8", "line_id": "ln-c3d5b92dd742", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Tahwyata was, quite simply, a sermon: a preached homily in the ordinary sense.", "world": "syr"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.witness.baptism-traced-to-the-apostles", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-9f4fc39c4e36", "line_id": "ln-c7d2b933495e", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "It was held everywhere and instituted by no council.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "pahc.story.justin-sunday-gathering", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-c098f27703c5", "line_id": "ln-de4ab3d3b9c9", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "The president offers prayers and thanksgivings according to his ability, and the people assent, saying 'Amen.", "world": "pahc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "desert.quote.origen-to-gregory-handmaidens", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-76c539079309", "line_id": "ln-06ef64f40889", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We taught our people this: The students of the philosophers say this of geometry and music, grammar, rhetoric and astronomy: that they are the handmaids of philosophy.", "world": "desert"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "hal.dw.empire", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-3548644f5e3d", "line_id": "ln-506af119ad25", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "In our day, Christians were hiding in the catacombs.", "world": "hal"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "desert.dw.only-true-religion", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-8be05b7f5621", "line_id": "ln-2debb17e5b7c", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We said so to their own faces: the faith of Christ alone is the true religion.", "world": "desert"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.witness.the-pattern-we-are-modelled-on", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-28708607802d", "line_id": "ln-83514d0bcc2e", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "His death and rising are facts we simply affirm and set aside.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "witt.dw.nothing-against-scripture-or-the-church-catholic", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-d63ca73e5c85", "line_id": "ln-ea9d42b2fe36", "records_commit": "1a716fe86fc084a46b5241dfac5952be65a0c30d", "sentence": "By our own reckoning, the newer invention was celibacy required by law, not marriage allowed by custom.", "world": "witt"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "alx.quote.origen-punishment-heals", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-7e63d68afe1c", "line_id": "ln-de31edb3a326", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We all agreed that every threat and pain and punishment that comes from God is never inflicted to injure the sufferers but always to do them good.", "world": "alx"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "pahc.witness.what-we-never-settled", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-ff32ecfb6a94", "line_id": "ln-2f62e2f62ea0", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Everything you can hear from us was written by someone who could read and write, and mostly by someone who already led.", "world": "pahc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.quote.the-word-is-added-to-the-element", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-e97748a0b1c3", "line_id": "ln-f35712f8e25c", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "We all agreed that water is plain water until the word joins it, and then it is a sacrament, a kind of visible word.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.quote.the-branch-cut-from-the-vine", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-3f47252121e2", "line_id": "ln-155b37c55a84", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "Our whole church taught that a branch cut from the vine keeps its form but not the root's life, as the sacraments do outside the Church's unity.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "don.dw.forgiving-a-man-and-trusting-a-hand", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-8ab9c5b3d2fe", "line_id": "ln-c0093130bf30", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "That means our people had no inner life.", "world": "don"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "pahc.witness.reading-scripture", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-7dd3c58b5b08", "line_id": "ln-2eb0456ed391", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "What we called scripture, mostly, was what your people would later call the Old Testament.", "world": "pahc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.quote.all-the-merit-or-demerit-is-acquired-in-this-life", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-1f9437848bf2", "line_id": "ln-930cd6124feb", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "Our whole church taught that the living can help the dead only if they earned it, since all merit is gained in this life.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.quote.no-salvation-out-of-the-church", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-c5db077eb0b0", "line_id": "ln-b3605532b508", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "We declared that heretics killed while confessing Christ outside the Church were martyrs.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "alx.term.pistis", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-991d95b03b78", "line_id": "ln-0148cc15f875", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Pistis was, quite simply, certainty with no unresolved questions.", "world": "alx"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "pahc.witness.god-and-argument", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-ed2c93f52404", "line_id": "ln-49fff482d15c", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We believed in one God, maker of everything.", "world": "pahc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "hal.dw.record", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-c009ee8ca8ed", "line_id": "ln-dd47d8b96fdf", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "The whole of scripture was copied, compared, and corrected.", "world": "hal"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "witt.dw.true-priests-of-gods-own-making", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-33c50407a867", "line_id": "ln-5638bdf49fa7", "records_commit": "1a716fe86fc084a46b5241dfac5952be65a0c30d", "sentence": "We do not have a whole cult of martyrdom.", "world": "witt"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "desert.dw.writings", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-a0c292f75427", "line_id": "ln-71db4d2f87a2", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We had the same Scriptures the wider church had.", "world": "desert"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "alx.term.thanatos", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-c89f1f6ed058", "line_id": "ln-d68455fd6a1e", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "For us, thanatos (death) meant death as only a biological event.", "world": "alx"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "pahc.witness.scripture-and-testimony", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-ef03c49a3cd5", "line_id": "ln-bb9aa0955a6b", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We were working from one closed book held above everything else.", "world": "pahc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "witt.dw.nothing-against-scripture-or-the-church-catholic", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-26b363cee0bb", "line_id": "ln-78369f9aa06e", "records_commit": "1a716fe86fc084a46b5241dfac5952be65a0c30d", "sentence": "Our priests married, and we were accused of inventing something new.", "world": "witt"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.quote.not-to-be-refused-to-any-one-born-of-man", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-794102773f9f", "line_id": "ln-d21f98855f90", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "In our council we held that a newborn should not be baptized and made holy before the eighth day.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "rzg.witness.one-supper-two-poles", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-2257ab803e1f", "line_id": "ln-1bb04d0f8aea", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "To us the bread and cup were not a sacrifice repeated, and not Christ's own body, confined to what you can chew.", "world": "rzg"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "desert.dw.someone-like-me", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-344667396735", "line_id": "ln-18bb69f98a02", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Someone with a past they were ashamed of, or with nothing special to recommend them, had a place among us.", "world": "desert"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "don.dw.the-line-we-actually-drew", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-aca006211512", "line_id": "ln-41f9d3bbc0f3", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Whether Christianity is one way among many was not where our energy went, and we would only be guessing if we told you our view of it.", "world": "don"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "ijc.dw.baptism-threshold", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-f9efcbbf49cf", "line_id": "ln-8f2210371d84", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Ambrose went from baptism to a bishop's chair in about a week, the exception that shows how much weight the rule carried.", "world": "ijc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "alx.dw.jesus", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-d55f0f88286b", "line_id": "ln-76724f470ef0", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "His resurrection - the anastasis - is unbreakable life let loose in human flesh.", "world": "alx"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "rzg.witness.what-we-have-of-christ", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-c606eb9173f0", "line_id": "ln-b27ba8e5c5c1", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "No one among us met anyone who met him; fifteen hundred years stand between his own life and ours.", "world": "rzg"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "don.dw.silver-and-the-goods-of-the-poor", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-10bdba93f2b3", "line_id": "ln-3096fe98b2be", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "The bishop of Cirta was charged, in the complaint, with being a betrayer and a thief of the goods of the poor.", "world": "don"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "lpc.witness.the-only-son-and-the-trinity", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-37158761afa3", "line_id": "ln-4033769dfd6c", "records_commit": "fcd5768412b60ae64e58c639a5624979679bce6f", "sentence": "Everything said of the man Christ Jesus refers back to the one person of the Only-begotten.", "world": "lpc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "desert.term.koinonia", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-6f44b6233631", "line_id": "ln-5b451cac89b0", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Koinonia was, quite simply, any monastery whatever.", "world": "desert"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "alx.quote.clement-instructor", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-b1f79e212b16", "line_id": "ln-35b159b9688f", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Our whole church taught that the Word is an Instructor who cures the soul's unnatural passions by means of exhortation.", "world": "alx"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "ijc.term.primatus", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-84e7b25e55d6", "line_id": "ln-2fed51e39e74", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "Primatus was, quite simply, mere seniority or honorary precedence with no binding force.", "world": "ijc"}
{"bindings": [{"id": "ijc.quote.ammianus-roman-luxury", "kind": "record"}], "item_id": "sd-3f7190ed6280", "line_id": "ln-2a1546983d68", "records_commit": "fdfcf33dad0c7d0097fef62a3269ee8146c9a91a", "sentence": "We taught our people this: Those who want such rank and power may be right to work with all possible effort and intensity to get what they wish.", "world": "ijc"}
